1
00:00:05,960 --> 00:00:09,000
YAMU! YAMU! YAMU! YAMU!

2
00:00:30,440 --> 00:00:31,558
You're on the move!

3
00:01:03,280 --> 00:01:06,986
Thank you for flying, and please
enjoy your stay here in Cairo.

4
00:01:08,200 --> 00:01:12,760
I just flew all the way to Egypt, and
boy, are my arms tired. Spare us, huh?

5
00:01:14,580 --> 00:01:15,980
Hey, hold up a sec.

6
00:01:16,120 --> 00:01:16,997
I'll be right back.

7
00:01:17,080 --> 00:01:17,910
What?

8
00:01:17,993 --> 00:01:21,268
We haven't even left the airport,
and she's shopping already?

9
00:01:22,040 --> 00:01:26,820
I think I'll take that snow globe
with the pyramids. Oh, great.

10
00:01:27,120 --> 00:01:28,937
Everyone here knows we're tourists now.

11
00:01:29,020 --> 00:01:29,860
So are they.

12
00:01:30,500 --> 00:01:32,040
Yugi, over here!

13
00:01:35,200 --> 00:01:37,320
Hey, it's Merrick! What's up?

14
00:01:37,680 --> 00:01:39,240
Long time no see, guys.

15
00:01:39,560 --> 00:01:41,497
Yeah, there's so much to talk about.

16
00:01:41,580 --> 00:01:42,477
Where do we begin?

17
00:01:42,560 --> 00:01:44,266
Well, let's start with lunch.

18
00:01:44,380 --> 00:01:46,137
How are the burger joints out here?

19
00:01:46,220 --> 00:01:47,926
May I speak with the pharaoh?

20
00:01:51,380 --> 00:01:52,840
My king, welcome.

21
00:01:53,280 --> 00:01:54,751
You've finally come home.

22
00:01:54,940 --> 00:01:59,037
You have quite a long journey ahead,
and we're so honored to be your guides.

23
00:01:59,120 --> 00:02:01,260
Please, the pleasure's mine.

24
00:02:04,760 --> 00:02:05,940
Check it out!

25
00:02:06,120 --> 00:02:08,591
So that's what a great pyramid looks like.

26
00:02:08,680 --> 00:02:09,510
Hey, look!

27
00:02:09,593 --> 00:02:10,737
That must be the Sphinx!

28
00:02:10,820 --> 00:02:12,217
What happened to his nose?

29
00:02:12,300 --> 00:02:13,182
You don't know.

30
00:02:13,360 --> 00:02:14,580
Oh, like you do? No.

31
00:02:16,600 --> 00:02:19,720
Beyond this door lies the
tablet of lost memories.

32
00:02:22,660 --> 00:02:25,760
All the secrets of my past
will finally be revealed.

33
00:02:26,900 --> 00:02:28,840
You must enter without us.

34
00:02:29,120 --> 00:02:30,677
And when you reach the tablet,

35
00:02:30,760 --> 00:02:35,497
hold up your Egyptian god cards, and the
gateway to your lost memories will open.

36
00:02:35,580 --> 00:02:39,020
From here on, you must forge
your own path, my pharaoh.

37
00:02:40,540 --> 00:02:41,370
Right.

38
00:02:41,453 --> 00:02:42,283
I understand.

39
00:02:43,500 --> 00:02:45,260
I've got a weird feeling.

40
00:02:45,560 --> 00:02:47,797
That's because you ate all those falafels.

41
00:02:47,880 --> 00:02:51,560
Well, I guess our job as tomb
keepers is finally complete.

42
00:02:51,900 --> 00:02:55,017
Our ancestors have awaited
this for 5,000 years.

43
00:02:55,100 --> 00:02:55,960
Yes.

44
00:02:56,440 --> 00:02:59,793
There is a place where every
soul must eventually return,

45
00:02:59,920 --> 00:03:03,685
and the Pharaoh has just begun
the journey to his resting place.

46
00:03:06,400 --> 00:03:07,694
That's right, Pharaoh.

47
00:03:07,980 --> 00:03:10,440
Open the gateway and seal your fate.

48
00:03:13,940 --> 00:03:16,881
You'd think they could
spruce this place up a bit.

49
00:03:16,980 --> 00:03:20,520
Hey, for a 5,000-year-old
sanctuary, it could be worse.

50
00:03:23,700 --> 00:03:26,840
there it is the tablet of lost memories

51
00:03:30,480 --> 00:03:35,117
poor guy his spirit's been around
for like centuries but his memory

52
00:03:35,200 --> 00:03:39,617
only goes back a few years i mean
he had this whole other life in

53
00:03:39,700 --> 00:03:43,737
ancient egypt and he doesn't remember
any of it not even his own name

54
00:03:43,820 --> 00:03:50,720
pharaoh i want you to have this
what is it it's a cartoon Cartouche.

55
00:03:50,820 --> 00:03:55,349
The guy in the store said ancient pharaohs
used to carve their names on them.

56
00:03:55,980 --> 00:03:59,680
But this cartouche is
completely blank, Taya. I know.

57
00:03:59,900 --> 00:04:01,057
That's why I bought it.

58
00:04:01,140 --> 00:04:05,117
I figured that when you get your memory
back, you can put your name there.

59
00:04:05,200 --> 00:04:08,376
That way you can be sure
you'll never forget it again.

60
00:04:08,880 --> 00:04:11,837
I remembered seeing a picture
of one on that tablet,

61
00:04:11,920 --> 00:04:13,861
but the name on it was worn away.

62
00:04:14,160 --> 00:04:17,677
But hopefully soon, your life
won't be a mystery anymore.

63
00:04:17,760 --> 00:04:19,640
I don't know what to say.

64
00:04:19,900 --> 00:04:21,253
I'll never take it off.

65
00:04:25,840 --> 00:04:27,369
According to the prophecy,

66
00:04:27,580 --> 00:04:32,117
as soon as I raise the three Egyptian god
cards before the Tablet of Lost Memories,

67
00:04:32,200 --> 00:04:38,080
my mind will be unlocked, and the
secrets of my past will be revealed.

68
00:04:40,040 --> 00:04:40,960
This is it.

69
00:04:49,960 --> 00:04:53,077
The portion of my spirit
I once infused within

70
00:04:53,160 --> 00:04:55,837
the Millennium Puzzle
will finally be released,

71
00:04:55,920 --> 00:04:57,979
and then the Shadow Game can begin.

72
00:04:59,860 --> 00:05:01,200
Go for it, Yuke.

73
00:05:01,420 --> 00:05:04,420
And no matter what happens,
we're right behind you.

74
00:05:26,580 --> 00:05:28,180
What's going on?

75
00:05:29,260 --> 00:05:32,140
Where are the Egyptian gods taking me?

76
00:05:53,260 --> 00:05:55,360
It looks like my plan worked

77
00:06:08,840 --> 00:06:11,160
I take it that was supposed to happen?

78
00:06:11,380 --> 00:06:16,077
I don't know, but thanks to that light I
think I'm gonna be seeing double for weeks

79
00:06:16,160 --> 00:06:17,400
Yugi! You alright?

80
00:06:18,000 --> 00:06:19,960
Hey, pal. Can you hear me?

81
00:06:20,820 --> 00:06:22,500
He's gone! Say, what?

82
00:06:22,980 --> 00:06:23,840
Who's gone?

83
00:06:24,100 --> 00:06:25,297
What are you talking about?

84
00:06:25,380 --> 00:06:28,220
It's the Pharaoh. He left. You're kidding.

85
00:06:28,800 --> 00:06:30,000
The boy is correct.

86
00:06:30,640 --> 00:06:33,940
The Pharaoh is now in
the world of his memory.

87
00:06:34,620 --> 00:06:35,450
Who's there?

88
00:06:38,920 --> 00:06:39,750
Shoddy!

89
00:06:39,833 --> 00:06:40,663
Is that you?

90
00:06:40,960 --> 00:06:44,136
Hey, you're that guy in the
bathrobe from Battle City.

91
00:06:45,100 --> 00:06:47,820
Tristan, we're done for! It's all right!

92
00:06:48,120 --> 00:06:49,414
Someone's got my hand!

93
00:06:51,900 --> 00:06:54,400
I told you guys I didn't imagine him!

94
00:06:54,740 --> 00:06:57,037
Yeah, well, how do we know
we can trust this guy?

95
00:06:57,120 --> 00:06:58,002
It's all right!

96
00:06:58,880 --> 00:07:01,586
Shoddy's the guardian
of the Millennium Items!

97
00:07:34,560 --> 00:07:35,700
Where am I?

98
00:07:37,080 --> 00:07:39,080
Your public awaits, my king.

99
00:07:39,320 --> 00:07:43,457
The citizens of Egypt are quite anxious
to pay respect to their new pharaoh.

100
00:07:43,540 --> 00:07:45,280
Did you say their pharaoh?

101
00:08:03,169 --> 00:08:03,999
We've prepared a lovely
ceremony in your honor, my king.

102
00:08:04,082 --> 00:08:05,614
Might I suggest you settle down in
your throne and enjoy the festivities?

103
00:08:13,280 --> 00:08:16,260
Ah, it's the big old chair straight ahead.

104
00:08:20,100 --> 00:08:23,180
Did I actually travel back in time?

105
00:08:30,000 --> 00:08:34,560
All hail the new pharaoh,
exalted ruler of Egypt!

106
00:08:38,160 --> 00:08:39,160
Kaiba?

107
00:08:39,480 --> 00:08:40,320
Isshizu?

108
00:08:40,780 --> 00:08:42,100
And grandpa?

109
00:08:42,480 --> 00:08:43,620
Who's grandpa?

110
00:08:44,380 --> 00:08:47,980
My pharaoh, perhaps we should
postpone the celebration.

111
00:08:48,380 --> 00:08:52,120
That won't be necessary.
Please, carry on. Very well.

112
00:08:55,440 --> 00:08:57,100
The time has come.

113
00:08:57,380 --> 00:08:59,997
Let us all welcome his
excellence to the throne of

114
00:09:00,080 --> 00:09:03,280
Egypt with the ceremonial
festival of the pharaohs.

115
00:09:08,480 --> 00:09:10,920
All of these people work for me?

116
00:09:18,220 --> 00:09:19,100
What's this?

117
00:09:19,260 --> 00:09:21,660
Each one of you holds a Millennium Item?

118
00:09:22,020 --> 00:09:23,260
Have you forgotten?

119
00:09:23,540 --> 00:09:26,097
These are the six members
of your secret court.

120
00:09:26,180 --> 00:09:29,057
They were chosen by the
Millennium Items themselves.

121
00:09:29,140 --> 00:09:32,905
Each one destined to wield its
power in the name of the Pharaoh.

122
00:09:37,500 --> 00:09:38,600
Keep moving.

123
00:09:38,980 --> 00:09:40,804
There's no rest for the wicked.

124
00:09:48,580 --> 00:09:49,480
Hold on.

125
00:09:49,740 --> 00:09:52,505
It seems our little friend
has collapsed again.

126
00:09:52,640 --> 00:09:53,580
Just my luck.

127
00:09:53,780 --> 00:09:56,237
There's a grand celebration at the palace.

128
00:09:56,320 --> 00:09:59,760
And I get stuck hauling a
petty thief to the dungeon.

129
00:10:03,480 --> 00:10:04,340
What's that?

130
00:10:13,620 --> 00:10:14,450
It worked.

131
00:10:14,620 --> 00:10:16,517
Of course, by the looks of these chains,

132
00:10:16,600 --> 00:10:19,017
it appears my timing
could have been better.

133
00:10:19,100 --> 00:10:22,806
But regardless, my journey into
the ancient past was a success.

134
00:10:44,820 --> 00:10:46,900
You are free, my lord

135
00:10:47,540 --> 00:10:50,260
I see that Now if memory serves me,

136
00:10:50,360 --> 00:10:53,157
there's work to be done
It's been a long time

137
00:10:53,240 --> 00:10:56,097
But I remember this day
from my past quite clearly

138
00:10:56,180 --> 00:10:59,077
It's the day the great
pharaoh inherited the throne

139
00:10:59,160 --> 00:11:02,940
of Egypt And he and I have
some catching up to do

140
00:11:14,080 --> 00:11:16,940
Have I actually been
transported back in time?

141
00:11:17,380 --> 00:11:19,900
Or is all this happening in my mind?

142
00:11:20,180 --> 00:11:22,800
The people here seem so familiar.

143
00:11:23,600 --> 00:11:25,997
Perhaps my experiences in the 21st century

144
00:11:26,080 --> 00:11:28,786
have somehow affected
my memories of the past.

145
00:11:29,280 --> 00:11:33,480
Or could it be that these people
really did live 5,000 years ago?

146
00:11:34,040 --> 00:11:35,511
Take Kaiba, for instance.

147
00:11:35,820 --> 00:11:38,857
He always seemed to have a
connection with ancient Egypt.

148
00:11:38,940 --> 00:11:43,764
And the fact that his image was etched in
that tablet can hardly be a coincidence.

149
00:11:55,480 --> 00:11:56,360
Mahat, quick!

150
00:12:01,520 --> 00:12:03,320
Guard, stop that intruder now!

151
00:12:03,500 --> 00:12:04,618
He is getting away!

152
00:12:11,660 --> 00:12:14,220
Bring this scoundrel before the pharaoh.

153
00:12:16,680 --> 00:12:19,677
Assaulting the king of Egypt
is an inexcusable crime.

154
00:12:19,760 --> 00:12:22,172
We are in the midst of a sacred ceremony.

155
00:12:22,280 --> 00:12:23,777
Cast this man to the dungeon.

156
00:12:23,860 --> 00:12:25,080
Wait, not yet.

157
00:12:26,120 --> 00:12:27,620
I have a better idea.

158
00:12:28,080 --> 00:12:30,077
Let us use this rogue to demonstrate for

159
00:12:30,160 --> 00:12:32,477
the new pharaoh the full
extent of our power.

160
00:12:32,560 --> 00:12:35,720
Don't you agree, Master
Ak-Nadden, Master Shimon?

161
00:12:36,840 --> 00:12:37,780
Very well.

162
00:12:38,100 --> 00:12:40,940
So let it be written, so let it be done.

163
00:12:41,220 --> 00:12:42,985
Let this man's judgment begin.

164
00:12:43,960 --> 00:12:44,790
Yes.

165
00:12:44,873 --> 00:12:47,580
Commence with the millennium
trial of this man's soul.

166
00:12:48,820 --> 00:12:50,440
A millennium trial?

167
00:12:50,900 --> 00:12:52,020
Yes, my king.

168
00:12:52,280 --> 00:12:55,574
With a position of great power
often comes great danger.

169
00:12:55,800 --> 00:13:00,257
And criminals that threaten the ruler
of Egypt must be dealt with accordingly.

170
00:13:00,340 --> 00:13:02,880
But you need not be alarmed, Pharaoh.

171
00:13:03,200 --> 00:13:07,937
We, the members of your sacred court, are
here to ensure your safety at all times.

172
00:13:08,020 --> 00:13:12,440
Thou shall now be judged by the dark
magic of the Seven Millennium Items!

173
00:13:13,200 --> 00:13:14,720
What does he plan to do?

174
00:13:16,500 --> 00:13:17,760
Shadda will start.

175
00:13:19,900 --> 00:13:23,840
Now, with the power of the Millennium
Key, I shall read your mind.

176
00:13:32,300 --> 00:13:36,020
The shadow of an evil creature
lurks inside his heart.

177
00:13:39,300 --> 00:13:42,780
I shall now invoke the
energies of the Millennium Eye,

178
00:13:43,040 --> 00:13:46,580
thus revealing and extracting
the being that dwells within.

179
00:13:52,880 --> 00:13:54,420
What's happening to him?

180
00:13:54,660 --> 00:13:56,997
The Millennium Items
have detected a shadow

181
00:13:57,080 --> 00:13:59,337
creature dwelling in the
heart of this criminal.

182
00:13:59,420 --> 00:14:02,185
Little is known about
these beings of darkness,

183
00:14:02,420 --> 00:14:05,477
only that they feed on the
anger and hatred of humans.

184
00:14:05,560 --> 00:14:10,140
Once a shadow creature is born, it
forces its host to commit acts of evil,

185
00:14:10,420 --> 00:14:13,100
creating even more darkness to feast upon.

186
00:14:16,800 --> 00:14:19,917
So the guardians of the Sacred
Court use the Millennium

187
00:14:20,000 --> 00:14:22,941
Items to seal these monsters
within stone tablets.

188
00:14:24,180 --> 00:14:27,100
Could those be the same
tablets from my visions?

189
00:14:28,180 --> 00:14:29,360
Master Seto,

190
00:14:29,580 --> 00:14:34,780
call upon the power of your Millennium Rod
and seal the fate of this shadow beast.

191
00:14:35,740 --> 00:14:36,570
Right.

192
00:14:36,680 --> 00:14:40,621
A creature from the realm of darkness
has no place in this kingdom.

193
00:14:42,140 --> 00:14:45,340
Now, Millennium Rod,
relinquish this beast.

194
00:14:45,640 --> 00:14:46,580
I beseech thee.

195
00:15:01,920 --> 00:15:02,750
Wait!

196
00:15:03,040 --> 00:15:05,720
Can this be the origin of Duel Monsters?

197
00:15:11,260 --> 00:15:12,520
So now what?

198
00:15:12,820 --> 00:15:15,720
The Pharaoh must relive his ancient past.

199
00:15:15,980 --> 00:15:18,640
It's the only way he
can fulfill his destiny.

200
00:15:19,120 --> 00:15:22,040
But this journey is a
gift as well as a curse.

201
00:15:22,300 --> 00:15:23,771
What do you mean, shoddy?

202
00:15:23,880 --> 00:15:26,720
The Pharaoh will finally
learn about his past.

203
00:15:27,100 --> 00:15:29,982
but he must defeat the
great evil all over again.

204
00:15:30,260 --> 00:15:31,240
That's not fair.

205
00:15:31,540 --> 00:15:34,397
We have to find him and bring
him back to the present.

206
00:15:34,480 --> 00:15:35,320
You cannot.

207
00:15:35,700 --> 00:15:38,177
Now that he is in the
realm of his memories,

208
00:15:38,260 --> 00:15:41,378
the only way he may return
is by reigning victorious.

209
00:15:42,020 --> 00:15:43,220
Victorious at what?

210
00:15:43,500 --> 00:15:45,180
The ultimate shadow game.

211
00:15:45,600 --> 00:15:49,659
A battle that decides not only his
own fate, but the fate of mankind.

212
00:15:50,240 --> 00:15:51,070
Hold on.

213
00:15:51,153 --> 00:15:53,877
The Pharaoh came here to
find out who he really is,

214
00:15:53,960 --> 00:15:56,019
not to put himself in danger again.

215
00:15:56,380 --> 00:15:58,457
You mean to tell me you
knew what he was getting

216
00:15:58,540 --> 00:16:01,364
himself into all along
and you still let him go?

217
00:16:01,980 --> 00:16:02,820
Hold on.

218
00:16:03,180 --> 00:16:05,480
This guy's some kind of a hologram.

219
00:16:06,060 --> 00:16:08,472
No, actually, I'm a centuries-old spirit.

220
00:16:09,900 --> 00:16:10,730
Yay!

221
00:16:10,813 --> 00:16:13,697
Why am I the only one who's freaked
out that we're talking to a ghost?

222
00:16:13,780 --> 00:16:15,060
Joey, let him speak.

223
00:16:15,660 --> 00:16:20,680
My earthly body was destroyed by a
tomb robber named Bakura. Bakura?

224
00:16:21,020 --> 00:16:22,260
Are you sure?

225
00:16:22,980 --> 00:16:27,320
He, too, is an ancient soul, a
wandering spirit, if you will.

226
00:16:27,600 --> 00:16:30,780
But he wants to use the
Millennium Items for evil.

227
00:16:31,360 --> 00:16:32,700
To do what?

228
00:16:33,000 --> 00:16:35,529
To release a creature
of ultimate darkness.

229
00:16:36,200 --> 00:16:41,100
And so, when the Pharaoh began his
journey into the realm of his memories,

230
00:16:41,420 --> 00:16:43,420
the spirit of Bakura followed him.

231
00:16:43,640 --> 00:16:46,037
Wait, so Bakura's back
there with the Pharaoh?

232
00:16:46,120 --> 00:16:46,950
That's right.

233
00:16:47,100 --> 00:16:50,337
He plans to use the Millennium
Items to dominate the planet.

234
00:16:50,420 --> 00:16:51,417
No, he can't!

235
00:16:51,500 --> 00:16:53,717
Well, the pharaoh beat him the first time.

236
00:16:53,800 --> 00:16:54,630
Right, Yook?

237
00:16:55,980 --> 00:16:58,317
Just because it happened
in the past doesn't

238
00:16:58,400 --> 00:17:01,017
mean it's guaranteed to
happen the same way again.

239
00:17:01,100 --> 00:17:05,117
That's true, and I hate to say it,
guys, but if the past is destroyed,

240
00:17:05,200 --> 00:17:07,200
so is the future. She's right.

241
00:17:07,420 --> 00:17:11,655
We have to go back to the past and
make sure the pharaoh defeats Bakura.

242
00:17:11,780 --> 00:17:15,437
There is only one way to enter
the realm of the pharaoh's memory.

243
00:17:15,520 --> 00:17:18,240
The doorway lies in the Millennium Puzzle.

244
00:17:18,680 --> 00:17:20,504
How are we supposed to find it?

245
00:17:23,420 --> 00:17:27,080
Trust me, my young friends,
and I will be your guide.

246
00:17:29,840 --> 00:17:33,520
One can never be dressed too
formally with visiting a palace.

247
00:17:34,500 --> 00:17:37,277
And since I wouldn't want
to show up empty-handed,

248
00:17:37,360 --> 00:17:40,357
I'll bring this sarcophagus
along as a peace offering.

249
00:17:40,440 --> 00:17:43,560
Now the king awaits,
and we mustn't be late.

250
00:17:47,960 --> 00:17:49,520
Well done, Sato.

251
00:17:50,140 --> 00:17:51,880
Thank you, Master Akhenaten.

252
00:17:52,320 --> 00:17:56,438
Now that we are done with him, let
us banish this fool to the dungeon.

253
00:17:57,160 --> 00:18:00,000
We have expelled the
darkness from his heart.

254
00:18:00,300 --> 00:18:04,977
Therefore, it is the duty of the Pharaoh's
sacred court to let this man walk free.

255
00:18:05,060 --> 00:18:05,960
Release him!

256
00:18:06,200 --> 00:18:10,480
If I am not mistaken, Mahad, palace
security is your responsibility.

257
00:18:12,300 --> 00:18:16,117
Perhaps you would like to shed some
light on this afternoon's events.

258
00:18:16,200 --> 00:18:19,200
How did that intruder make
it past the royal guard?

259
00:18:19,820 --> 00:18:21,320
Master Seto is right.

260
00:18:22,700 --> 00:18:25,040
Please accept my apologies, Pharaoh.

261
00:18:25,740 --> 00:18:29,564
The Millennium Ring has been
behaving quite strangely as of late,

262
00:18:29,760 --> 00:18:32,584
making it difficult to
detect criminal activity.

263
00:18:33,100 --> 00:18:38,041
May I have your permission to increase
security forces to fortify the city, my king?

264
00:18:38,580 --> 00:18:40,480
Yes, of course. Please do.

265
00:18:41,140 --> 00:18:44,280
Now store that creature
in the Tablet Sanctuary!

266
00:18:48,120 --> 00:18:49,600
Who was that intruder?

267
00:18:49,880 --> 00:18:51,351
And will there be others?

268
00:18:53,060 --> 00:18:53,890
Varo,

269
00:18:53,973 --> 00:18:56,917
might I suggest that we move
on and continue with the

270
00:18:57,000 --> 00:19:00,600
coronation festivities as
quickly as we possibly can? What?

271
00:19:00,780 --> 00:19:03,280
I was just attacked! That's true.

272
00:19:03,400 --> 00:19:07,757
However, if your loyal followers sense
your fear, they too will feel unsafe.

273
00:19:07,840 --> 00:19:11,722
And the best way to hide that fear
is with merriment and laughter.

274
00:19:13,080 --> 00:19:13,910
Well,

275
00:19:14,120 --> 00:19:21,020
I'll try Let the festival of the pharaohs
continue Wait Is there a problem,

276
00:19:21,220 --> 00:19:22,050
Isis?

277
00:19:22,700 --> 00:19:28,100
My millennium necklace senses an evil
force approaching the kingdom How close?

278
00:19:28,380 --> 00:19:29,792
Shimon, what's going on?

279
00:19:30,060 --> 00:19:36,080
This being lurks just outside the
palace walls And he bears a great power

280
00:19:39,460 --> 00:19:43,107
I think it's time we made our
presence known, don't you agree?

281
00:19:43,380 --> 00:19:44,720
Yes, my lord.

282
00:19:45,100 --> 00:19:48,040
Then let the ultimate shadow game begin!
